title: In the Dock
subtitle: A comrade stands trial.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('c_trial'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
var c = RG.lw.fire('c_trial');
RG.lw.setC('cm', c);
c.lw_tried = Q.time;
Q.lw_name = RG.pick(['the State Court in Leipzig', 'the regional court in ' + RG.pick(RG.lw.TOWNS[c.district || 'berlin']), 'the special court in Berlin-Moabit']);
RG.news('Trial of ' + c.name + ' opens before ' + Q.lw_name);
!}

= In the Dock

**[+ lw_cm_name +]** is brought up from the cells to face [+ lw_name +]. The charge is preparing high treason. The public gallery is full of workers who queued since dawn, and of plain-clothes police who did not need to queue.

The presiding judge served as a reserve officer in the war, and says so. The prosecutor has a file of speeches and leaflets an inch thick. Our lawyer has one question for the Zentrale before the trial begins: what kind of defence does the party want?

- @tribune: Turn the dock into a tribune.
- @legal: Fight the case on the law, point by point.
- @refuse: Refuse to recognise a class court.
- @plea: Advise a plea and a promise of good conduct.

@tribune
subtitle: A great speech, a longer sentence. The workers will read every word. The Left and the Spartacists both cheer.
on-arrival: {!
var c = RG.comrade(Q.lw_cm);
if (c && c.until > 0) { c.until += 5; }
Q.worker_support += 3;
Q.militancy += 2;
RG.news(Q.lw_cm_name + ' in court: "I accuse this Republic"', 2);
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 1, 3);
RG.lw.lean('luxemburgist', 1, 3);
!}

[+ lw_cm_name +] speaks for three hours, about the war, the murders of January and the officers who were never tried. The judge interrupts eleven times. The speech is printed as a pamphlet the next week, and the sentence is long.

@legal
subtitle: A careful defence. An acquittal is possible; the speech will be forgotten.
on-arrival: {!
if (Math.random() < 0.45) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.free(Q.lw_cm, {news: Q.lw_cm_name + ' acquitted', priority: 2});
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
}
RG.lw.lean('unionist', 1, 3);
!}

Our lawyer takes the prosecution's file apart: dates that do not match, a police witness who was in another city. [? if lw_out = 1 : The court acquits for lack of evidence. [+ lw_cm_name +] walks out into the arms of the crowd. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : The court convicts all the same, on a lesser count. The sentence stands. ?]

@refuse
subtitle: Defiance from first to last. A longer sentence, and the hard men of the party approve.
on-arrival: {!
var c = RG.comrade(Q.lw_cm);
if (c && c.until > 0) { c.until += 3; }
Q.militancy += 3;
Q.worker_support += 1;
if (Q.ultraleft_gone) { RG.lw.lean('offensive', 1, 4); } else { RG.lw.lean('ultraleft', 1, 4); RG.lw.lean('offensive', 1, 1); }
!}

[+ lw_cm_name +] turns away from the bench and says nothing for the whole trial, except, at the end, that the proletariat will judge its judges. The court is cleared twice.

@plea
subtitle: Freedom soon, and a stain. The comrade's current is ashamed, and the party a little smaller in the workers' eyes.
on-arrival: {!
RG.free(Q.lw_cm, {news: Q.lw_cm_name + ' released after a plea'});
Q.worker_support -= 1;
var c = RG.comrade(Q.lw_cm);
if (c) { RG.lw.lean(c.faction, -1, -6); }
Q.unity -= 1;
!}

The lawyer reads out a short statement: [+ lw_cm_name +] regrets any words that went too far, and respects the constitution. The court is satisfied. The party's paper prints the release, and not the statement.
